---
import ArchwayLayout from '../layouts/ArchwayLayout.astro';
import HeroComplianceBooking from '../components/compliance/HeroComplianceBooking.astro';
import ComplianceBody from '../components/compliance/ComplianceBody.astro';
import BottomCTA from '../components/shared/BottomCTA.astro';
---

<ArchwayLayout
  title="When Did Your Agency Last Restore From Its Backup? | Archway"
  description="Book a 30-minute backup review and find out what your backup covers, how long a restore would take, and what a restore test involves."
  ctaText="Book My Backup Review"
  ctaHref="#hero-form"
>
  <HeroComplianceBooking
    badge="Cybersecurity Awareness Month"
    formTitle="Book Your Backup Review"
    headline="When Did Your Agency Last <span class='hl'>Restore From Its Backup?</span>"
    subhead="Book a 30-minute backup review and find out what your backup covers, how long a restore would take, and what a restore test involves."
    formId="1b1111a8-5676-4e36-abaa-526149652cfa"
    submitText="Book My Backup Review"
    showFallback={false}
  />
  <ComplianceBody
    bodyHtml="<p>Most agencies can say they have a backup. Far fewer can say when someone last restored a file from it.</p><p>A backup you have never restored from is a guess. The job reports success every night, and nobody finds out what is missing until the day it is needed. That day is usually a ransomware day or a dead server.</p><p>In 30 minutes we go through what your backup covers, what it leaves out, and how long your team would be down while everything comes back. Then we walk through what a restore test involves.</p>"
    bullets={[
      "Servers, workstations, and shared files",
      "Microsoft 365 or Google Workspace mailboxes and documents",
      "Management system data, hosted or on-site",
      "What is not being backed up at all",
      "How long a full restore would take",
      "What a restore test involves, and how often to run one"
    ]}
    authorityLine="Archway works exclusively with independent insurance agencies, on Applied Epic, AMS360, HawkSoft, EZLynx, and the other management systems agencies run on."
    whoThisIsFor="Agency owners and operations managers who have a backup in place and have never watched it restore."
  />
  <BottomCTA
    heading="Find out whether your backup would come back."
    subtext="Thirty minutes by phone or video. We follow up within one business day to schedule it."
    ctaText="Book My Backup Review"
    ctaHref="#hero-form"
  />
</ArchwayLayout>
